{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rope_coil","model_identifier":"rope_coil","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## rope_coil\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.2..1.2, y -16.0..0.8, z -5.2..5.0 (size 2.5 x 16.8 x 10.2 u = 7 x 47 x 29 cm).\nRope coil: a coil of rope (~30 cm across) hanging from the fist by its top, a binding wrap on one side and one loose end trailing down. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 16.0.\n"},"description":"## rope_coil\n\nCarried load, made goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.2..1.2, y -16.0..0.8, z -5.2..5.0 (size 2.5 x 16.8 x 10.2 u = 7 x 47 x 29 cm).\nRope coil: a coil of rope (~30 cm across) hanging from the fist by its top, a binding wrap on one side and one loose end trailing down. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 16.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-1.0,-3.5],"to":[1.0,0.75,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,11,2.0,12.75],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[3,8,10.0,9.75],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[2,11,4.0,12.75],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10,8,17.0,9.75],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[16,0,18.0,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[18,0,20.0,7.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8f8d96dc-548b-5bd3-b1cb-e3c7858fe162"},{"name":"front","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-9